  "adaptations": [
    "Faithful native layout adaptation, not a pixel-identical copy of generated concept art; all displayed values come from the real processor.",
    "The observatory draws a perspective stack of the current actual oscillator preview. It is not represented as a live spectrum or a sweep of different wavetable frames.",
    "All eight native macros are displayed in the reference's top-right macro strip, replacing the six-knob concept arrangement.",
    "Only actual Surge oscillator algorithms and dynamically named parameters are offered. The concept-only generic Sample and Granular modes are not fabricated.",
    "Filter plots are explicitly labeled response previews. Real cutoff, resonance, keytracking and envelope-amount controls remain independently bound to each filter.",
    "The visible envelope is native ENV 1; ENV 2, the other LFOs, modulation routing and all sixteen effect slots remain available through Full editor.",
    "The output section shows actual output meters. Open scope leads to the native detailed analyzer rather than displaying a fabricated spectrum.",
    "The native header supplies preset navigation, scene selection, skin selection and Full editor access; decorative observatory artwork and concept-only navigation tabs are not reproduced."
  ]
